{"id":"u-8035a387-ff80-4d06-b593-0ee0b49206f4","src":"community","title":"My Program","author":"Donovan C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/y7YDRI-my-program","desc":"A push/pull/legs program built to pack on thick, powerful, athletic muscle — the dense linebacker look, not just lean definition. Everything trains twice a week across six days, with volume deliberately loaded toward the muscles that make a physique look strong: traps, side and rear delts, and upper back get top-end set counts, while heavy trap-bar deadlifts, squats, and RDLs anchor the program in real strength and posterior-chain thickness. Loaded carries and direct neck work round out the powerful, built-from-behind appearance.\nEach day pairs heavier strength work (4–6 and 6–8 rep ranges, 2 reps in reserve) with higher-rep hypertrophy and isolation work taken close to failure, and the whole thing runs on double progression: add reps until you hit the top of each range, then add weight and reset. Designed for an experienced lifter with the recovery capacity to handle high frequency and high volume — deload every 5–6 weeks to keep joints, lower back, and connective tissue fresh.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-09T19:44:56.822Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"